  "about": "Where a book resumes: the device's record against the server's reading-progress (adopt when clearly newer, 90 s margin; one position for the active view; rounding), and the record kept per member — saved, cleared, paused. The server's row is served by the fake household and read through the API (GET reading-progress), as the book page does, so its decoding is part of each case; a failed read is no row.",
